---
title: "Signing in with a passkey"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> idle
  idle: signed out
  asked: sign in pressed
  begun: login begun
  challenged: challenge sent
  prompting: phone asks
  signed: face checked
  returned: signature back
  checking: login finishing
  lookup: key asked for
  keyed: key found
  signed_in: signed in
  state face <<choice>>
  state valid <<choice>>
  idle --> asked: sign in
  asked --> begun: begin
  begun --> challenged: challenge
  challenged --> prompting: ask the phone
  prompting --> face: Face ID
  prompting --> face: a stranger looks
  face --> signed: [face matches]
  face --> idle: [else]
  signed --> returned: signature
  returned --> checking: finish
  returned --> checking: replay an old one
  checking --> lookup: find the key
  lookup --> keyed: public key
  keyed --> valid: verify
  valid --> signed_in: [signature fits]
  valid --> idle: [else]
  signed_in --> idle: sign out
